Error [E0120]: `value` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> tests/ui/param_owned_field_needs_copy_explicit.jet:7:57
    |
  7 | fn wrap(value: String) Holder -> { return Holder{value: value} }
    |                                                         ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `~value`
